457 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Shopping Wishlist Manager demonstrates how a singly linked list, manually written sorting and searching logic, methods and file handling can be combined to build a useful console application. It follows the project requirements: IDs start from W101, prices must be greater than 0, removing an item does not change the remaining IDs, and the data is loaded from wishlist.txt at the start and saved on exit. The project is simple and easy to demonstrate, and it can be extended in the future with the features listed under Future Scope.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 406 0 R
>>
endobj
